9. Open Questions
VIP vs. rigid foam cost/performance tradeoff — needs a real comparison once a prototype exists; VIP is a meaningfully different cost and installation-tolerance story
THERMWEAVE steady-state output vs. cyclical applications — flagged above, worth measuring rather than assuming
Fire rating at the insulation core — same open question already logged against the base FORGE chassis; closed-cell foam cores in particular need a real fire-code pass
